{
  "description": "Create an organization-owned Plugin and its first version by uploading the\nversion's files.\n\nThe upload is `multipart/form-data`: the version's files (`files`, each part sent\nas `files[]`), with an optional `marketplace_id` and `release_notes`. The manifest's `name` becomes the\nPlugin's `name`, and `display_name`, `description` and `manifest_version` come\nfrom the manifest too.\n\n`name` may contain lowercase letters (from any alphabet), digits, and hyphens, up\nto 64 characters. Uppercase letters, spaces, underscores, and other punctuation are\nrejected.\n\nThe `name` must be unique within the marketplace: a name already taken\nreturns a 409 with `error_code` `plugin_name_taken` and, when a Plugin holds it,\nthat Plugin's ID in `details.plugin_id`. A Plugin going into the organization's\nlibrary marketplace is also refused with a 409 when one of its skills has the name of\nan organization skill (a skill an administrator uploaded for the whole organization\nin claude.ai): `error_code` `skill_name_taken`, with that name in\n`details.skill_name`; rename the skill, or remove the organization skill in\nclaude.ai. A 503 with `error_code`\n`registration_pending` means the Plugin and its version were stored (their IDs are\nin `details`) but are not yet usable in claude.ai: do not retry the create (the\nretry would return `plugin_name_taken`); create a version on the stored Plugin\ninstead, which completes it.\n\nFor a worked example, see [Create a plugin](/docs/en/manage-claude/plugins-api#create-a-plugin)\nin the Plugins API guide.\n\n**Accepted credentials:** an Admin API key with the `write:plugins` scope.\n\nEvery request must include the beta header `anthropic-beta: ce-plugins-2026-09-01`. A request without it returns `404`, exactly as if the endpoint did not exist. The Plugins API is in beta and is available to Claude Enterprise organizations only. It is not available to Claude Platform (Claude Console) organizations, or to organizations with HIPAA readiness enabled.",
  "operationId": "beta_create_plugin_v1_organizations_plugins_post",
  "parameters": [
    {
      "description": "This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `ce-plugins-2026-09-01` in this header.",
      "in": "header",
      "name": "anthropic-beta",
      "required": false,
      "schema": {
        "description": "This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `ce-plugins-2026-09-01` in this header.",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AnthropicBeta"
        },
        "title": "Anthropic-Beta",
        "type": "array"
      }
    }
  ],
  "requestBody": {
    "content": {
      "multipart/form-data": {
        "schema": {
          "properties": {
            "files": {
              "description": "The version's files: one part per file, the part's filename being the file's path within the Plugin (for example `skills/review-pr/SKILL.md`), or a single `.zip` or `.plugin` archive holding them all. On the wire each part is named `files[]`, and a part named plain `files` is not read; with cURL, `-F 'files[]=@SKILL.md;filename=skills/review-pr/SKILL.md'`. The files must include the manifest, `.claude-plugin/plugin.json`.",
              "items": {
                "format": "binary",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            "marketplace_id": {
              "description": "ID of the organization-owned plugin marketplace to create the Plugin in (prefixed `marketplace_`). It must be a `manual` marketplace, one whose Plugins are uploaded rather than synchronized from a repository. When omitted, the Plugin is created in the organization's library marketplace, an organization-owned `manual` marketplace created on first use.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "release_notes": {
              "description": "Release notes stored with the version and shown in its version history in claude.ai; up to 5,000 characters.",
              "maxLength": 5000,
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "files"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    "required": true
  },
